  m_text: 'modifiers allow you to add visual effects to a map. they require that
    the user has authorable modifiers installed in order for the modifiers to work.


    open
    the modifier panel with {0} <size=70%>if you''re using default keybinds: the
    letter, not the number</size>

    select modifiers with <color=#FDA50F>left
    click</color>

    delete modifiers with <color=#FDA50F>right click</color> or
    {1} if one is selected

    activate modifier preview by pressing {2}. this works
    when the modifier panel is closed, too.

    modifiers fully support copy, cut,
    paste, undo and redo.


    for more information about specific modifiers and
    how to use them, refer to the modifier help panel ({3})


'
