  m_text: 'the statistics panel is opened by pressing the <color=#FDA50F>book icon</color>
    at the bottom.


    it displays various stats about your map, such as..

    ..notes
    per second (nps),

    ..numbers of each target type and their distribution for
    left/right,

    ..a heatmap, showing how you used the available space,

    ..a
    difficulty rating for your map (which can also be found under <color=#FDA50F>song
    info</color>)'
