  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>writing reviews</b>


    first, load the map and difficulty you want
    to write a review for.


    to write a review, you first have to change the
    window''s mode from "read" to "write". you can do so by pressing the <color=#FDA50F>toggle
    mode</color> button. afterwards, enter your name at the top left.


    press
    the <color=#FDA50F>select cues</color> button to select cues of a section you
    want to comment on. after confirming your selection by pressing <color=#FDA50F>done</color>,
    you can write your comments into the input field.


    you can select the type
    of comment using the dropdown at the top.


    you can make a suggestion by
    first creating a comment, then selecting it, and finally pressing <color=#FDA50F>make
    suggestion</color>. you then edit the highlighted targets and press <color=#FDA50F>done</color>
    once you''re finished.


    click save & open once you''re done and upload the
    file on discord.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8d6ffc87ae696bb49b961911c4703d7d, type: 2}
