  m_text: 'pathbuilder allows you to build complex paths by dragging and aligning
    points on the grid.

    a path can consist of multiple segments, with each segment''s
    values being controllable individually or globally, depending on the selected
    scope. chains you create in  default and simple mode are both saved, so you can
    switch between them at any time. note that you can''t create a pathbuilder target
    for previously created legacy pathbuilder targets.'
