  m_text: 'presets allow you to save selected targets and reuse them in other maps.
    you can also share your presets by uploading them on our discord, or download
    presets from other members of our community.


    this tool is especially handy
    for some fancy chains you might create.


    <color=#FDA50F>open</color> the
    presets menu by pressing the folder icon at the bottom.

    <color=#FDA50F>select</color>
    a preset by simply clicking on the picture.

    <color=#FDA50F>insert</color>
    a preset by pasting ({0}) after selecting a preset.


    <color=#FDA50F>create</color>
    a preset by first selecting the targets you want to create the preset for, then
    opening the preset menu, and finally entering a name and pressing <color=#FDA50F>create</color>
    at the bottom right.

    <color=#FDA50F>delete</color> a preset by clicking
    the x icon on a preset.


    your presets are located at notreaper/presets

'
