  m_text: '<b>reading reviews</b>


    to read a review, you first have to load
    one. place your downloaded review file in your review folder, located at notreaper/reviews


    next,
    open the review menu, press load in the left panel, and select the review file.


    once
    loaded, select comments in the right panel or navigate through them using the
    <color=#FDA50F>prev</color> and <color=#FDA50F>next</color> buttons.


    some
    comments have a little lightbulb icon, indicating that there is a suggestion
    attached to it. after selecting a comment with a lightbulb, press <color=#FDA50F>show
    suggestion</color> in the center panel to see the suggestion on your grid. you
    can choose to apply the suggestion or cancel it.


    once you''re done with
    a comment, you can mark it as checked by pressing the <color=#FDA50F>check comment</color>
    button in the center panel.

'
