    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "open the repeater menu with <color=#FDA50F>F7</color>\nselect targets
    and enter a name to create a repeater.\nwhile the repeater menu is open, drag
    the end handle on the timeline to adjust the repeater's length (doesn't affect
    other instances of that same repeater).\nwhile the repeater menu is open, click
    on an existing repeater to select it. \nparent repeaters are indicated by dark
    blue lines at the top and bottom. child repeaters do not have those.\nif a child
    repeater is selected (selection will be highlighted in <color=green>green</color>),
    you can mirror colors and direction.\n\n<color=orange>f</color>\\t\\t flips target
    colors of selected child repeater\n<color=orange>h</color>\\t\\t mirrors selected
    child repeater horizontally\n<color=orange>v</color>\\t\\t mirrors selected child
    repeater vertically\n<color=orange>u</color>\\t\\t makes selected repeater unique\n<color=orange>delete</color>\\t
    deletes the selected repeater\n<color=orange>b</color>\\t\\t bakes the selected
    repeater "
