    it plays the map in 3D so you can see how your
    map will play like in AUDICA.


    you can select different skyboxes from the
    dropdown at the left.


    by default, the camera is being controlled automatically.
    if you click onto the play space however, you can manually move the camera around
    by dragging.


    toggling on the modifiers option also previews the modifiers
    you created.


    you can hide the ui by pressing the arrow icon in the middle
    of the bottom panel.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8d6ffc87ae696bb49b961911c4703d7d, type: 2}
