  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "after creating a new map, you'll be asked to align the bpm. you do so
    by dragging the timeline.\n\nenter the correct bpm for your song if you haven't
    already and check if it lines up with the song. you can check by pressing {0}
    to play the song with a <color=#FDA50F>metronome</color>. \n\nonce satisfied,
    press <color=#FDA50F>continue</color>. notreaper will now append silence until
    at least 2 seconds are reached. we do this so there is enough lead-in to the
    song. it also allows you to comfortably create a count in if you wish ({1}).\n\nafter
    the silence as been added, you can still add or remove silence from the track.
    enter the number of beats you want to add or remove in silence or simply press
    <color=#FDA50F>finish</color> to start mapping.\n\nif you don't drag the timeline
    at all at the beginning, there will be no silence added. \n<color=#FF6060>only
    skip this step if you align your audio externally beforehand!"
