  m_text: 'there''s 4 types of handles

    <color=red><size=10>you need at least
    2 segments for handles to work</color></size>


    cycle all handles with {0}

    cycle
    handle you''re hovering over with {1}


    free

    no assistance on handles


    <color=purple>aligned</color>

    keeps
    handles opposite one another


    <color=green>vector</color>

    removes handles,
    resulting in straight lines


    <color=yellow>automatic</color>

    positions
    handles automatically to create smooth curves. you have no control over them
    in this mode.'
