  m_text: '<color=#FDA50F>hold ctrl</color> to select and make changes to targets.

    {0}
    or <color=#FDA50F>ctrl + click</color> in an empty spot will clear your selection.


    if
    you select multiple targets on the grid, the <color=#FDA50F>transform tool</color>
    will appear (yellow box). release control and drag the rotate icon or the arrows
    to rotate or scale the targets. if you hold <color=#FDA50F>shift</color>, the
    arrows will stretch the targets on the arrow''s axis.


    additional shortcuts

    {1}
    - copies the current selection

    {2} - pastes the selection at the current
    time

    {3} - swaps colors for the selection

    {4} - deletes the selected
    notes'
